WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.384 --> 00:00:18.946
I should confess," thought Ben in a panic.

2
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.667
Maybe if he told Mr.

3
00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:26.530
Freaky the truth, the principal could find a way to get Mayor Hubbletree to change his mind about

4
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.051
the school.

5
00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:29.152
But Ben wasn't sure.

6
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:33.966
He was new at Monster Academy and still learning how things worked there.

7
00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:37.507
Maybe he'd just better stay quiet for now.

8
00:00:40.929 --> 00:00:43.890
At lunch that day, Ben wanted to be alone to think.

9
00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:48.792
He found a table with two zombies and sat down.

10
00:00:50.513 --> 00:00:55.355
While the zombies stared and drooled silently on their food, Ben thought about his situation.

11
00:00:56.575 --> 00:00:58.476
Nearby he heard Winnie talking.

12
00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:04.999
"I can't believe Mayor Hubbletree is going to destroy Monster Academy," she said.

13
00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:07.700
"What's going to happen to us?

14
00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:09.681
Where will we go to school?"

15
00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:11.642
"Believe it!"

16
00:01:12.043 --> 00:01:12.943
a mummy replied.

17
00:01:12.963 --> 00:01:16.705
"And just wait until he finds the ghost who scared his son.

18
00:01:17.005 --> 00:01:19.106
That ghost is going to be in big trouble!"

19
00:01:22.068 --> 00:01:23.309
Ben looked over at Winnie.

20
00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:25.890
To his surprise, she smiled at him!

21
00:01:27.231 --> 00:01:31.837
Ordinarily Ben would have been thrilled, but today he had too much on his mind.

22
00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:35.158
"I have to find Mog," he thought.

23
00:01:36.418 --> 00:01:40.279
Once he talked to Mog, Ben could make a plan, figure out what to do.

24
00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:47.661
But Ben didn't have a chance to talk with Mog until the next morning in cooking class.

25
00:01:54.143 --> 00:01:58.004
Mrs. Hag assigned the two of them to make a rotten-egg omelet together.

26
00:02:00.008 --> 00:02:03.889
"Mog!" Ben growled as soon as they were alone at their cooking station.

27
00:02:03.909 --> 00:02:06.630
"You got me into trouble!"

28
00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:10.251
"It wasn't my fault," said Mog.

29
00:02:10.971 --> 00:02:12.892
He cracked a rotten egg into a bowl.

30
00:02:12.912 --> 00:02:15.592
"What do you mean, it wasn't your fault?"

31
00:02:16.052 --> 00:02:17.813
Ben glared at the big monster.

32
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:20.714
"I know you knocked over those garbage cans.

33
00:02:20.994 --> 00:02:23.774
You made a big loud sound just to get me in trouble.

34
00:02:24.175 --> 00:02:26.755
And you're probably the one who's flying the brooms!"

35
00:02:27.896 --> 00:02:29.256
"Monsters, quiet!"

36
00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:30.341
snapped Mrs.

37
00:02:30.381 --> 00:02:34.384
Hag. "You're supposed to be cooking, not talking."

38
00:02:35.425 --> 00:02:36.686
Ben lowered his voice.

39
00:02:36.706 --> 00:02:40.709
"You knew the big house with the tower was the mayor's mansion.

40
00:02:41.169 --> 00:02:43.751
I'll bet you never saw any witches' brooms on the roof.

41
00:02:44.151 --> 00:02:47.354
You just wanted to get me into trouble because Winnie is nice to me!"

42
00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.176
Mog's shoulders slumped.

43
00:02:50.196 --> 00:02:53.219
"Okay," he said.

44
00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.820
"You're right.

45
00:02:55.188 --> 00:02:57.249
I made the whole thing up to get you in trouble.

46
00:02:57.829 --> 00:02:59.429
The brooms were never on the roof.

47
00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.930
I knocked over the garbage cans.

48
00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:05.011
But I just wanted you to get in a little bit of trouble.

49
00:03:05.631 --> 00:03:08.292
I didn't know the whole thing would turn into such a big deal."

50
00:03:09.332 --> 00:03:12.693
Ben noticed Winnie glancing over at Mog as the monster spoke.

51
00:03:12.713 --> 00:03:15.094
"Well, it is a big deal!"

52
00:03:15.474 --> 00:03:16.735
Ben whispered furiously.

53
00:03:16.755 --> 00:03:21.196
"What's going to happen once they find out it was me who entered People Place?

54
00:03:21.632 --> 00:03:22.852
That was your plan.

55
00:03:23.152 --> 00:03:26.113
So you'd better help me find a way to fix the problem it caused!"

56
00:03:27.014 --> 00:03:28.254
Mog nodded slowly.

57
00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:31.135
"You're right, Ben," he said.

58
00:03:31.155 --> 00:03:33.215
"I'm really sorry.

59
00:03:33.595 --> 00:03:35.896
But I'm not the one who's taking the brooms, I swear."

60
00:03:37.296 --> 00:03:38.017
Ben nodded.

61
00:03:39.437 --> 00:03:42.298
For the first time, Mog actually seemed sincere.

62
00:03:43.318 --> 00:03:45.299
He was pretty sure Mog was telling the truth.

63
00:03:45.319 --> 00:03:50.000
"Meet me outside after school, by the flagpole," Mog said.

64
00:03:51.776 --> 00:03:53.377
"We'll come up with a plan together."

65
00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.421
After school Ben hurried outside.

66
00:04:00.402 --> 00:04:01.983
He was shocked by what he saw.

67
00:04:02.723 --> 00:04:05.966
Several large construction vehicles sat in front of the school.

68
00:04:07.006 --> 00:04:10.148
A big bulldozer rumbled loudly, puffing smoke.

69
00:04:11.149 --> 00:04:14.151
In front of the vehicles stood a man dressed in a dark suit.

70
00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:16.913
A few other people stood behind him.

71
00:04:16.933 --> 00:04:20.595
"That must be Mayor Hubbletree," thought Ben.

72
00:04:24.092 --> 00:04:27.695
Mr. Freaky ran out of the school, waving his arms frantically.

73
00:04:27.715 --> 00:04:29.937
"Mayor Hubbletree!"

74
00:04:30.357 --> 00:04:31.258
cried the principal.

75
00:04:31.278 --> 00:04:33.280
"What are you doing?"

76
00:04:37.804 --> 00:04:40.726
told you yesterday, Freaky," said the mayor.

77
00:04:40.746 --> 00:04:43.829
"I'm knocking this place to the ground!"

78
00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.232
"I didn't know you meant so soon!"

79
00:04:47.832 --> 00:04:48.313
said Mr.

80
00:04:48.373 --> 00:04:52.196
Freaky. "We need time to move our things out!"

81
00:04:53.176 --> 00:04:56.458
"The ghost who scared my little boy should have thought of that!"

82
00:04:57.459 --> 00:04:58.900
Mayor Hubbletree shot back.

83
00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:02.182
"Mayor, please," said Mr.

84
00:05:02.222 --> 00:05:06.565
Freaky. "Over two hundred monsters attend Monster Academy.

85
00:05:06.965 --> 00:05:08.226
Where will they go to school?

86
00:05:08.627 --> 00:05:11.008
Can't you at least wait until next week?"

87
00:05:12.289 --> 00:05:14.250
Mr. Freaky's lip began to tremble.

88
00:05:15.291 --> 00:05:17.373
Ben thought the principal was about to cry.

89
00:05:18.693 --> 00:05:19.734
The mayor sighed.

90
00:05:19.754 --> 00:05:22.376
"Oh, all right.

91
00:05:23.004 --> 00:05:24.465
I'll give you one more day.

92
00:05:24.725 --> 00:05:25.806
But that's all!"

93
00:05:29.108 --> 00:05:31.329
Ben found Mog and rushed over to him.

94
00:05:31.349 --> 00:05:33.170
"Did you hear that?"

95
00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.250
asked Ben.

96
00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.852
"We only have one day.

97
00:05:37.232 --> 00:05:39.293
You need to think of an idea—fast!"

98
00:05:40.374 --> 00:05:41.414
Mog shook his head.

99
00:05:41.434 --> 00:05:43.716
"I can't think fast."

100
00:05:47.738 --> 00:05:50.900
Ben was about to say something, but Mog put up a claw.

101
00:05:52.008 --> 00:05:54.529
"I can think slowly though," he said.

102
00:05:54.549 --> 00:05:56.350
"And I have an idea."

103
00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.951
"What is it?"

104
00:05:58.512 --> 00:05:59.132
asked Ben.

105
00:05:59.152 --> 00:06:04.035
"We should sneak back into People Place," said Mog.

106
00:06:05.175 --> 00:06:06.476
"What!" cried Ben.

107
00:06:06.496 --> 00:06:09.177
"Sneak back into People Place?

108
00:06:09.618 --> 00:06:10.918
That's your big idea?"
